  "historyNote": "#2221, eff 12-23-82; ss by #2979, eff 2-21-85; EXPIRED: 2-21-91 New. #5798, eff 3-18-94, EXPIRED: 3-18-00 New. #7568-A, eff 10-1-01, EXPIRED: 7-1-18",
